---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Shellui | The web app development platform
description: Shellui is an open-source web app development platform. Navigation, authentication, administration, and storage are built in so your team ships sooner without rebuilding basic features.
ogTitle: Ship sooner without rebuilding basic features
ogDescription: Open-source web app platform with navigation, authentication, administration, and storage built in.
---
{% set heroVariant = heroVariant or "A" %}
{% if heroVariant == "A" %}{% include "hero-a.njk" %}{% elif heroVariant == "B" %}{% include "hero-b.njk" %}{% else %}{% include "hero-current.njk" %}{% endif %}

    <section id="features" class="relative z-10 page-x py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
            A shared foundation for your apps
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            Bring your apps together with shared navigation, sign-in, administration, email, and file storage. Choose the features your product needs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/features/apps-and-navigation/"
          class="group mt-12 grid overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900 lg:grid-cols-2"
        >
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-center p-8 sm:p-10 lg:p-12">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl dark:text-white">
              Apps and navigation
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
              Combine apps built with different frameworks in one interface. Shellui handles the surrounding navigation and layout. Connect each app to shared dialogs, notifications, and settings through the SDK.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary-ink group-hover:underline">
              Explore apps and navigation
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex min-h-64 items-center bg-gray-50 p-8 dark:bg-gray-950/60 sm:min-h-80 sm:p-10">
            <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-md">
              {% include "shell-layout-anim.njk" %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <ul class="mt-6 divide-y divide-gray-200 border-y border-gray-200 dark:divide-gray-800 dark:border-gray-800">
          <li>
            <a href="/features/authentication/" class="group flex flex-col gap-1 py-6 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:gap-8">
              <span class="shrink-0 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:w-44">Authentication</span>
              <span class="min-w-0 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Share one sign-in flow across your apps. Use OAuth, Security Assertion Markup Language (SAML), magic links, or Supabase Auth, and choose which pages require a session.</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/features/storage/" class="group flex flex-col gap-1 py-6 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:gap-8">
              <span class="shrink-0 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:w-44">Storage</span>
              <span class="min-w-0 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Upload, browse, and share files through the SDK. Control access with file permissions, share links, and storage limits.</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/features/administration/" class="group flex flex-col gap-1 py-6 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:gap-8">
              <span class="shrink-0 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:w-44">Administration</span>
              <span class="min-w-0 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Manage members, email, webhooks, and company access from the administration panel. Add your own internal tools to its sidebar.</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/features/email/" class="group flex flex-col gap-1 py-6 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:gap-8">
              <span class="shrink-0 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:w-44">Email</span>
              <span class="min-w-0 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Send sign-in mail, event mail, newsletters, and broadcasts. Use Resend or SMTP, the standard mail protocol, and keep sign-in mail on its own queue.</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/features/web-and-desktop/" class="group flex flex-col gap-1 py-6 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:gap-8">
              <span class="shrink-0 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:w-44">Web and desktop</span>
              <span class="min-w-0 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Build the shell as static web files, host them anywhere, or package it as a desktop app with Tauri.</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="mt-8">
          <a href="/features/" class="text-sm/6 font-semibold text-primary-ink hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">
            See all features
          </a>
        </p>

        <div class="mt-16">
          {% set playgroundCtaWide = true %}
          {% include "playground-cta.njk" %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {% include "home-init.njk" %}

    {% include "home-config.njk" %}

    {% include "home-deploy.njk" %}

    <section id="audience" class="border-t border-gray-200 page-x py-24 dark:border-gray-800">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
            Same shell as you grow
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
            MIT license, one CLI, one static build. Optional native desktop from the same project. The host does not fork when a second surface or a second team shows up.
          </p>
        </div>
        <dl class="mt-12 max-w-3xl space-y-8">
          <div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[10rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
            <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Shared chrome</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-base/7 text-gray-600 sm:mt-0 dark:text-gray-400">Several frontends, one product shell. Each surface keeps its own stack.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[10rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
            <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Host extras</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-base/7 text-gray-600 sm:mt-0 dark:text-gray-400">Navigation, auth, admin, and files ship with the shell so your app stays the product.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[10rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
            <dt class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Yours to run</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-base/7 text-gray-600 sm:mt-0 dark:text-gray-400">Build static files, host them where you already ship, or distribute the output yourself.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="sm:grid sm:grid-cols-[10rem_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-8">
            <dt class="flex items-center gap-2 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
              {% set tauriIconClass = "size-4" %}
              {% include "tauri-icon.njk" %}
              Native desktop
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-base/7 text-gray-600 sm:mt-0 dark:text-gray-400">
              <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-[0.8rem] dark:bg-gray-800">shellui build --app</code> wraps the same shell with Tauri 2. See
              <a href="/features/web-and-desktop/#desktop" class="font-medium text-primary-ink hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">Features</a>
              and the
              <a href="{{ site.docs }}/tauri/" class="font-medium text-primary-ink hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">desktop docs</a>.
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <p class="mt-12 text-sm/6 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
          <a href="/architecture/" class="font-medium text-primary-ink hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">Architecture</a>
          ·
          <a href="{{ site.docs }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">Documentation</a>
          ·
          <a href="/changelog/" class="font-medium text-primary-ink hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">Changelog for {{ productVersion }}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    {% if site.newsletter.key %}
      <section id="newsletter" class="border-t border-gray-200 page-x py-24 dark:border-gray-800">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
          {% set newsletterVariant = "details" %}
          {% set newsletterId = "home-newsletter" %}
          {% include "newsletter-signup.njk" %}
        </div>
      </section>
    {% endif %}
